<title>TUNISIA: Tunisian Monoprix reports '96 profits.</title>
<headline>Tunisian Monoprix reports '96 profits.</headline>
<dateline>TUNIS 1997-03-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Tunisia's main retail stores firm SNMVT-Monoprix had a net profit of 4.88 million dinars in 1996, slightly up from 4.79 million dinars in 1995, results showed on Friday.</p>
<p>Turnover was 43.21 million dinars in 1996.</p>
<p>Privately-owned Monoprix is listed at the Tunis Stock Exchange since last year when it sold to the public a 10 percent stake in its capital which is now at 24.565 million dinars.</p>
<p>Its price ranged between 52.2 dinars and 33.1 dinars in 1996. It was last priced 36.0 dinars.</p>
<p>--Tunis newsroom, 2161-787538</p>
</text>
